### Dataset & Third-Party Asset Notice
This repository contains code for experimental pipelines and data verification.
The underlying raw microscopy images and primary annotations are derived from the
Uganda Sickle Cell Disease Dataset (Florence Tushabe et al., Soroti University /
Makerere University, Uganda, 2023), which is distributed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0). Third-party pretrained model weights
(ImageNet ResNet-18) are subject to torchvision's model zoo distribution terms.
